-- plain --
[Fail2Ban] sshd: banned 192.0.2.10 from host1.example.org
host1.example.org: Fail2Ban <root@host1.example.org>

Hi,

The IP 192.0.2.10 has just been banned by Fail2Ban after
5 attempts against sshd.

Regards,

Fail2Ban
